"Also mirror it into IPTC-IIM (JPEG, only when the file has no other IPTC "
"block)"
msgstr ""
"Zusätzlich in IPTC-IIM spiegeln (JPEG, nur wenn die Datei keinen fremden "
"IPTC-Block hat)"

